<title>FRANCE: Schneider sees significant '97 improvement.</title>
<headline>Schneider sees significant '97 improvement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French electrical engineering group Schneider SA said on Tuesday it expected a significant improvement in its 1997 results compared to 1996.</p>
